== c1_lunch | Lunch with Mizuno
@bg bg_classroom_day
@bgm daily
> By lunch, Mizuno Natsuki has learned the names of half the class, answered "Sendai, most recently" about twenty times, been invited to two clubs, and agreed to go to karaoke with a group of girls whose names I don't think I've ever said out loud.
> I'm impressed. I'm also slightly exhausted just watching.
> I've barely gotten the lid off my lunch when a chair scrapes behind me.
@show natsuki school_smirk c
natsuki: "So. You're Fujisawa." || ふーん。きみが、ふじさわかあ。
kohei(deadpan): "That's what the attendance sheet says." || 出席簿には、そう書いてあるな。
natsuki<smirk>: "The guy who turned down three confessions last year." || 去年、告白を三回断った人。
> I put my chopsticks down.
kohei(annoyed): "Is that in the welcome packet?" || それ、転校生向けの案内に載ってるのか？
natsuki<laugh>: "Someone told me before I'd even put my shoes in my locker. I'm not kidding. The girl by the door was very passionate about it." || 下駄箱に靴を入れる前に、もう聞かされたよ。ほんとだって。ドアの近くの子が、すっごく熱く語ってた。
kohei(deadpan): "Great." || ……最高だな。
natsuki<smile>: "She said you told every one of them you didn't have time for a girlfriend. Is that true?" || 全員に「彼女を作る時間がない」って言ったんだって。ほんと？
kohei(neutral): "It's true that I don't have time." || 時間がないのは、本当だ。
natsuki<smile>: "Huh." || へえ。
> She props her chin on her hand and looks at me like she's reading a scorecard.
natsuki<smirk>: "That's either really honest or really sad. I can't decide." || それって、すっごく正直なのか、すっごく寂しいのか。決められないなあ。
kohei(smile): "Let me know when you do." || 決まったら教えてくれ。
natsuki<smile>: "I will. I'm very decisive. Usually." || うん、教える。私、決断力あるから。……だいたいは。
> Something about the way she says it makes me laugh.
natsuki<smirk>: "Okay, you're fun. So what are you, {shodan|first dan}?" || ふふ、きみ、面白いね。で、段は？ 初段？
kohei(smile): "We'll find out on the floor." || 竹刀を交えればわかる。
natsuki<laugh>: "Oh, he's cocky. Good. I hate practicing with polite people." || おっ、自信家だ。いいね。礼儀正しいだけの相手と稽古するの、苦手なんだ。
kohei(neutral): "Club starts Wednesday." || 部活は水曜からだ。
natsuki<smile>: "Wednesday." || 水曜日。
> She repeats it like she's writing it on the inside of her wrist.
